{"id":"f6ffd36213690e39","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset.md","title":"ZFC Kappa Closed Poset","display":"df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset — ZFC Kappa Closed Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset","58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-closed-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset — ZFC Kappa Closed Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-closed.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-closed-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-kappa-closed-poset — ZFC Kappa Closed Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bef75a54dc1e374b\" href=\"?note=bef75a54dc1e374b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-closed.md\">../batch16/58-df-closed.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaClosedPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaClosedPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P^\\lambda\\;\\left(\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\lambda\\;(p(\\eta)\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p(\\xi))\\to\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p(\\xi))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P^\\lambda\\;\\left(\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\lambda\\;(p(\\eta)\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p(\\xi))\\to\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p(\\xi))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{KappaClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-closed-poset</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-closed.md","status":"resolved","id":"bef75a54dc1e374b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-closed.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnch